and most likely more than they should pay. Unfortunately, the proceeds
are not distributed to the unlanded, but are kept for the expenses of
the state apparatus.

> The economic benefits of a property system have been well
> established and accepted even among liberal economists.

I accept it as well, only not for everything, and not in exactly the
same form for everything.

